WEBVTT

00:16.830 --> 00:17.870
We've arrived.

00:21.830 --> 00:24.599
Hm? Where's King?

00:24.600 --> 00:26.379
He should've been at the rear.

00:26.380 --> 00:28.470
I saw him running off.

00:28.800 --> 00:32.759
I'm gonna go to my position early,
so don't worry about me.

00:32.760 --> 00:36.099
Everyone should stick
to the scheduled timing for the assault.

00:36.100 --> 00:37.309
That's what he said.

00:37.310 --> 00:41.689
He acts on his own like it's nothing.

00:41.690 --> 00:44.000
Why didn't he tell me directly?

00:44.650 --> 00:47.029
Am I still being treated like a kid?

00:47.030 --> 00:52.239
He acts fast.
That's just how he is.

00:52.240 --> 00:55.659
I was hoping to see King
in action up close.

00:55.660 --> 00:56.869
What a shame.

00:56.870 --> 00:59.709
He has his own way
of doing things.

00:59.710 --> 01:00.619
Yeah.

01:00.620 --> 01:01.500
Hey...

01:02.290 --> 01:04.000
Check out what's ahead.

01:04.800 --> 01:07.379
Looks like they're rolling out
the welcome party for us.

01:07.380 --> 01:09.880
Whoa... They just keep showing up.

01:10.300 --> 01:13.340
Master Atomic,
I sense them behind us too.

01:13.750 --> 01:16.100
Not just behind us.

01:25.440 --> 01:26.620
An old rag...?

01:35.780 --> 01:36.949
Damn that Gyoro-Gyoro.

01:36.950 --> 01:40.200
He said he wouldn't pull any tricks,
yet this was a trap all along?!

01:48.380 --> 01:54.589
The heat signature surrounding us
has exceeded 80... 110... 150.

01:54.590 --> 01:55.849
And still rising.

01:55.850 --> 01:58.099
Enough with the toys, Child Emperor.

01:58.100 --> 02:01.059
There's no point in counting them.

02:01.060 --> 02:03.730
Any boys lacking confidence,
just stay behind me!

02:04.850 --> 02:06.689
Well, well...

02:06.690 --> 02:08.479
Oh my...

02:08.480 --> 02:12.319
I heard the Hero Association
was sending in its full fighting force,

02:12.320 --> 02:13.990
but this is it?

03:44.000 --> 03:45.989
COUNTERSTRIKE

03:45.990 --> 03:49.330
What you should be counting...
are your sins.

04:06.100 --> 04:07.809
This phenomenon...

04:07.810 --> 04:09.310
Is it psychic power?!

04:10.310 --> 04:11.780
Grudges...

04:14.230 --> 04:18.700
These eyes belong to the monsters
killed by heroes.

04:19.040 --> 04:23.349
I was a weak psychic,
but Gyoro-Gyoro implanted these into me.

04:23.350 --> 04:25.759
By harnessing the remnants
of their lingering grudges,

04:25.760 --> 04:28.920
my strength was amplified.

04:30.290 --> 04:32.999
Now that the time for
vengeance has come...

04:33.000 --> 04:35.130
they are all weeping!

04:50.480 --> 04:51.729
What on earth?!

04:51.730 --> 04:53.309
That's Tornado's barrier.

04:53.310 --> 04:55.229
Thank you very much, Tornado...

04:55.230 --> 04:57.319
Noooo!

04:57.320 --> 05:00.950
Hey Tornado!
Protect us till the end!

05:03.530 --> 05:04.740
Tornado?

05:05.160 --> 05:08.499
Why should I protect all of you?

05:08.500 --> 05:09.120
What?!

05:09.670 --> 05:10.580
Take cover.

05:10.960 --> 05:13.040
Angel Fwip-Fwap.

05:14.250 --> 05:15.339
- Wow!
- Wow!

05:15.340 --> 05:17.450
Hey, you two. Careful.

05:20.420 --> 05:22.390
BANG

05:29.310 --> 05:30.979
What's wrong, Tornado?!

05:30.980 --> 05:33.189
Why are you saying that
at this crucial moment?

05:33.190 --> 05:36.899
If you can't handle this yourselves,
then just leave right now.

05:36.900 --> 05:38.440
There's no point in being here.

05:38.800 --> 05:40.399
You're just in the way.

05:40.400 --> 05:42.409
I agree.

05:42.410 --> 05:44.380
Wow! That's rare!

05:44.740 --> 05:45.489
HNNGG

05:45.490 --> 05:49.500
Their role isn't to be a burden,
but support, isn't it?

05:50.540 --> 05:54.209
They knew exactly
what they were stepping into.

05:54.210 --> 05:56.670
You're supposed to be support too...

05:56.980 --> 06:00.880
Don't tell me you're too scared
to move?

06:01.300 --> 06:03.340
If you guys are heroes...

06:03.840 --> 06:05.600
Then show me what you're made of.

06:08.220 --> 06:11.429
Even with that power boost
gathered from low-life energies,

06:11.430 --> 06:13.729
this is clearly your limit.

06:13.730 --> 06:15.020
Give it up.

06:15.600 --> 06:18.120
I hear your younger sister
is also a psychic.

06:18.690 --> 06:20.740
I just had a great idea.

06:22.190 --> 06:25.520
I'll gouge out the eyes
of you and your sister...

06:26.760 --> 06:29.409
Fusing them together would be
an interesting experiment.

06:29.410 --> 06:31.829
You sure talk a lot
for a garbage bag.

06:31.830 --> 06:34.870
Fine... Looks like I need to teach you
a little something.

06:35.210 --> 06:36.290
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

06:37.590 --> 06:40.800
This is what happens
when you mess with us!

06:41.130 --> 06:42.610
Ridiculous.

06:52.100 --> 06:54.440
So this is the Terrible Tornado...

06:56.400 --> 06:58.609
They're scared!

06:58.610 --> 06:59.899
Get 'em!

06:59.900 --> 07:00.860
Yahh!

07:02.570 --> 07:04.029
Don't underestimate us!

07:04.030 --> 07:07.660
We're more than capable
of protecting ourselves.

07:09.700 --> 07:11.010
Death Loop!

07:13.910 --> 07:15.870
CLASS A RANK 11, TWINTAILS

07:16.790 --> 07:17.829
Heh.

07:17.830 --> 07:21.299
Take your show to hell,
you clown.

07:21.300 --> 07:26.339
While that annoying girl who can stop bullets
and use barriers is distracted and acting stupid,

07:26.340 --> 07:30.260
I'm gonna pick them off one by one
from a safe distance.

07:36.850 --> 07:38.310
CLASS A RANK 22, ONE-SHOTTER

07:38.730 --> 07:40.230
Tch, it's that guy!

07:41.730 --> 07:43.069
What's with this vine...?!

07:43.070 --> 07:45.989
You can control plants?

07:45.990 --> 07:47.279
CLASS A RANK 24, GREEN
Yes, well...

07:47.280 --> 07:49.709
Since childhood, I've nurtured them
inside my own body,

07:49.710 --> 07:51.490
even sharing
my nervous system with them.

07:51.950 --> 07:54.279
Now's your chance to finish them off.

07:54.280 --> 07:54.949
Got it!

07:54.950 --> 07:58.539
I'll blast straight through!
Crescent Moon Consecutive Cuts!

07:58.540 --> 08:00.499
CLASS A RANK 25,
CRESCENT MOON THICKBROWS

08:00.500 --> 08:02.250
CLASS A RANK 29, NARCISSTOIC

08:02.670 --> 08:06.169
Check this out.
My rival, Amai Mask!

08:06.170 --> 08:08.219
Feast your eyes on
my beautiful technique.

08:08.220 --> 08:10.340
Shut it, you pointy-chin punk!

08:20.730 --> 08:23.110
DAZZLING
Soft-Touch Execution!

08:23.480 --> 08:28.359
Wow, not bad.
He's got star power.

08:28.360 --> 08:30.320
So that's the renowned
beautiful technique.

08:31.250 --> 08:33.700
And that's the Featherweight
Midair Murder Method.

08:34.450 --> 08:36.200
CLASS A RANK 34, FEATHER

08:45.050 --> 08:46.760
CLASS A RANK 32, SHADOWRING

08:47.110 --> 08:48.720
Nice moves.

08:49.130 --> 08:51.430
Where did you train
in the ninja arts?

08:51.840 --> 08:53.430
I'm not like you.

08:54.890 --> 08:59.600
Indeed. There were no women
where I trained.

08:59.930 --> 09:01.669
They're better than I thought.

09:01.670 --> 09:03.770
I guess there's no need to worry.

09:04.160 --> 09:05.859
Yes, they're all Class-A heroes.

09:05.860 --> 09:09.989
Without the S-Class around,
they'd be at the very top.

09:09.990 --> 09:11.949
CLASS B RANK 29, DOUBLE HOLE
And the others are no less formidable.

09:11.950 --> 09:13.659
CLASS B RANK 50,
JET NICEGUY (UPDATED)

09:13.660 --> 09:15.119
CLASS C RANK 66,
FOOD BATTLER FUTOSHI

09:15.120 --> 09:16.579
CLASS C RANK 3,
MONSTER ROPER SHELL

09:16.580 --> 09:17.329
CLASS B RANK 60, NEEDLE STAR
Take this!

09:17.330 --> 09:18.790
CLASS B RANK 60, NEEDLE STAR
I'll turn you into minced meat!

09:23.080 --> 09:24.420
Step aside.

09:28.510 --> 09:29.759
The wound is too shallow?!

09:29.760 --> 09:30.839
Doesn't matter.

09:30.840 --> 09:31.429
CLASS C RANK 300, POISON

09:31.430 --> 09:33.139
It's coated with deadly poison.

09:33.140 --> 09:36.060
With this knife,
even a scratch is fatal.

09:36.400 --> 09:38.080
- See?
- Ah?!

09:40.810 --> 09:42.230
All right!

09:45.190 --> 09:47.900
CLASS B RANK 71, CAPTAIN MIZUKI
In Lane 1, Captain Mizuki!

09:48.570 --> 09:49.649
On your mark...

09:49.650 --> 09:50.240
Go!

09:55.280 --> 09:56.570
The first event is...

09:57.490 --> 09:59.039
THUD

09:59.040 --> 10:00.499
Pole vault!

10:00.500 --> 10:02.959
SWOOSH

10:02.960 --> 10:04.920
- Wow!
- Wow!

10:11.590 --> 10:12.550
The second event.

10:12.970 --> 10:14.049
SHING
Javelin throw!

10:14.050 --> 10:15.509
THUMP

10:15.510 --> 10:16.470
CRASH

10:19.140 --> 10:20.769
The third event...

10:20.770 --> 10:22.020
Hammer throw!

10:30.990 --> 10:32.440
Now!

10:32.820 --> 10:34.410
Got her!

10:35.030 --> 10:36.280
Why you little...!

10:42.500 --> 10:44.960
- Owww...
- Take this!

10:48.000 --> 10:49.840
Nice muscles.

10:50.380 --> 10:52.459
Yeah, thank you.

10:52.460 --> 10:56.090
But aside from track and field,
all I can do is grapple.

11:01.600 --> 11:02.559
Whoa!

11:02.560 --> 11:05.309
Yuck! I squeezed too hard.

11:05.310 --> 11:07.809
Be sure not to overstrain your muscles.

11:07.810 --> 11:11.530
I'll do my best so you guys
can conserve your stamina.

11:12.650 --> 11:15.489
N-No. Stay away from me.

11:15.490 --> 11:19.329
Ugh, crap, crap!
Something's off today.

11:19.330 --> 11:22.700
Come on, activate, psychic powers!

11:25.750 --> 11:28.249
CLASS C RANK 133, GEARSPER
All right. My powers activated!

11:28.250 --> 11:31.249
I wonder what that kid's doing,
crouched down like that?

11:31.250 --> 11:32.419
Never mind him.

11:32.420 --> 11:32.960
CLASS A RANK 4, BUSHIDRILL
CLASS A RANK 3, OKAMAITACHI

11:33.510 --> 11:35.930
The others appear
to be all right too.

11:36.510 --> 11:38.000
That was easy.

11:38.930 --> 11:40.100
So far.

11:40.470 --> 11:42.139
It was an elegant victory.

11:42.140 --> 11:43.889
Something doesn't feel right.

11:43.890 --> 11:45.560
The enemy was too weak.

11:46.520 --> 11:50.189
They sent in the underlings
even though they knew they'd lose.

11:50.190 --> 11:53.230
Their aim can't just be to wear us down.

11:53.570 --> 11:54.779
Don't let your guard down!

11:54.780 --> 11:56.450
There's more on the way!

11:58.780 --> 12:00.619
They look a little stronger?

12:00.620 --> 12:02.309
Outta the way!
I'll handle this.

12:02.310 --> 12:04.409
We won't need help from Orochi
or our leaders.

12:04.410 --> 12:10.389
Rhino-Wrestler will finish off
those heroes who were lured out.

12:10.390 --> 12:13.989
I was kicked out of the Blizzard Bunch
for fighting with the members.

12:13.990 --> 12:17.299
So, I've been waiting for a chance
to prove myself again.

12:17.300 --> 12:19.590
This is my time to rise to the top.

12:20.720 --> 12:22.219
Take this! My special move...

12:22.220 --> 12:24.430
Violence Star!

12:25.680 --> 12:26.430
What the...?

12:30.230 --> 12:33.440
Violence Star... I give it 25 points!

12:40.990 --> 12:43.390
The fourth event.
Shot put!

12:45.950 --> 12:47.540
30 points!

12:52.520 --> 12:53.750
Th-Thank you.

12:56.130 --> 12:58.470
Get back.
This one's tough as nails!

13:06.810 --> 13:08.539
He's tougher than I expected.

13:08.540 --> 13:11.270
I tried to pierce through his horn
into his forehead, but...

13:11.670 --> 13:13.519
You moron. Aim for his heart!

13:13.520 --> 13:17.230
I'll give your shooting...
only about 15 points.

13:17.820 --> 13:20.569
Day after day,
I've trained relentlessly.

13:20.570 --> 13:23.629
To become the strongest
being on earth.

13:23.630 --> 13:28.949
To prove my ultimate power.
That desire alone...

13:28.950 --> 13:30.910
is what keeps my fire burning!

13:31.670 --> 13:34.879
Hey, come on.
Don't run away! Bring it on.

13:34.880 --> 13:37.299
So I can give you a score.

13:37.300 --> 13:39.260
CLASS A RANK 2, IAIRON

13:46.600 --> 13:48.560
69 points!

13:48.970 --> 13:52.349
Iairon stopped his charge!
Press the attack, now!

13:52.350 --> 13:53.649
- Yeahh!
- Yeahh!

13:53.650 --> 13:58.860
18 points, 12 points, 9 points,
20 points, 2 points!

14:00.940 --> 14:02.399
H-He's so strong!

14:02.400 --> 14:04.779
He's amazingly tough.

14:04.780 --> 14:06.119
Damn him.

14:06.120 --> 14:09.539
I took on your attacks head-on
and then crushed you.

14:09.540 --> 14:11.830
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON, RHINO-WRESTLER
There's no thrill greater than that.

14:13.790 --> 14:17.749
Every so often, a monster will evolve
suddenly in a short span of time.

14:17.750 --> 14:21.009
So what about it?
Is that all you got, heroes?

14:21.010 --> 14:24.220
Come on, give me your strongest!

14:24.760 --> 14:27.599
My evolution is far from over.

14:27.600 --> 14:30.929
Even during battle,
I get stronger by the second!

14:30.930 --> 14:36.649
It was a pleasant surprise to see a few of
our grunts with that same trait. However...

14:36.650 --> 14:39.359
That's enough, Iairon.
I'll take it from here.

14:39.360 --> 14:42.109
Master Atomic...
Let me fight a little more...

14:42.110 --> 14:44.109
No more waiting.

14:44.110 --> 14:47.529
Now's not the time
for your stubbornness.

14:47.530 --> 14:50.280
You've become obsessed with
cutting his horn, haven't you?

14:50.870 --> 14:51.830
I'll cut him down.

14:52.370 --> 14:53.539
Cut me down?!

14:53.540 --> 14:56.520
Didn't you just watch me fight?

14:57.170 --> 15:00.299
Well, at least
you get credit for having guts.

15:00.300 --> 15:02.589
A-Atomic Samurai!

15:02.590 --> 15:05.049
Blades don't work on that monster.

15:05.050 --> 15:06.929
He'll destroy them both.

15:06.930 --> 15:09.349
Hit me with your best shot!

15:09.350 --> 15:11.770
I'll give you a score!

15:14.650 --> 15:16.979
All right.
We're done here.

15:16.980 --> 15:20.999
Let's move on.
Everyone still on their feet?

15:21.000 --> 15:23.689
Huh? We're far from done here.

15:23.690 --> 15:27.279
Hey, don't ignore me!

15:27.280 --> 15:28.449
Huh?

15:28.450 --> 15:31.029
Oh right...

15:31.030 --> 15:32.200
So what's my score?

15:37.120 --> 15:41.650
So frustrating... Dammit...
Gyoro-Gyoro...

15:44.590 --> 15:49.340
So, Gyoro-Gyoro.
What threat level am I at now?

15:49.670 --> 15:51.389
Am I still a Tiger?

15:51.390 --> 15:54.560
When we first met,
you were definitely a Tiger.

15:54.990 --> 15:57.019
But now, you are a Demon.

15:57.020 --> 16:00.470
I can't wait to see you fight.

16:02.020 --> 16:04.070
But you said...

16:04.530 --> 16:09.490
I was strong...
You said I could beat Class-S heroes...

16:10.070 --> 16:12.450
You lied to me.

16:13.790 --> 16:15.510
100 points...

16:16.790 --> 16:18.490
Thank you.

16:21.040 --> 16:22.729
He got Rhino-Wrestler!

16:22.730 --> 16:23.839
How?

16:23.840 --> 16:26.550
No idea. But his only weapon
is a single blade.

16:26.920 --> 16:29.049
If we all attack at once,
we can kill him.

16:29.050 --> 16:31.260
He must be their strongest.

16:40.850 --> 16:45.370
I don't think there's enough of you
to take me on.

16:46.230 --> 16:47.820
Wow...

16:48.860 --> 16:51.819
Oh, there's more of you?

16:51.820 --> 16:54.790
Fine, I'll kill you all.

16:59.580 --> 17:02.330
Playtime is over.
Get to work.

17:05.340 --> 17:08.409
That was so fast.
I couldn't even see what he did.

17:08.410 --> 17:10.800
This is Flash's quick technique?

17:11.180 --> 17:13.549
Even killing one will make us look good.

17:13.550 --> 17:15.969
- Go after the weak ones.
- Yeah!

17:15.970 --> 17:17.929
Yikes, they're after me!

17:17.930 --> 17:19.390
No worries! Bring it on!

17:20.390 --> 17:22.720
Huh? Blackluster?

17:23.440 --> 17:25.860
Are you tired?
You should rest a little.

17:26.230 --> 17:29.569
In front of you! Look in front of you!
They're attacking.

17:29.570 --> 17:31.820
Give your muscles a break.

17:38.660 --> 17:41.900
He's crushing the monsters
by ramming into them!

17:42.290 --> 17:44.580
Just what kind of training do you do?

17:47.710 --> 17:49.800
My turn now.

17:51.050 --> 17:52.130
Stay back, everyone...

18:10.360 --> 18:12.270
Did you see that, boys?

18:12.840 --> 18:13.820
It's okay...

18:15.160 --> 18:16.680
to fall for me.

18:17.780 --> 18:19.369
WHOOSH

18:19.370 --> 18:21.080
Hey, you're all too far away.

18:26.960 --> 18:29.089
He must really hate you.

18:29.090 --> 18:31.970
To still keep his shape
after fighting Tornado.

18:32.380 --> 18:33.720
You think so?

18:35.680 --> 18:38.100
I didn't really notice.

18:42.310 --> 18:43.980
Hmm...

18:45.060 --> 18:46.120
Found you!

18:47.900 --> 18:49.720
No more spying!

18:50.110 --> 18:51.899
I've already seen enough.

18:51.900 --> 18:55.069
Although I wish
I were able to see King fighting.

18:55.070 --> 18:59.280
Ahh, I see.
I think I got it figured out now.

19:00.580 --> 19:03.750
I was just getting in the mood to kill,
why did you summon me?

19:04.440 --> 19:06.990
So? What exactly have you figured out?

19:09.000 --> 19:12.010
All right! We've taken care of
all the monsters that appeared.

19:12.840 --> 19:15.549
The surface team will now
stand by at the central point.

19:15.550 --> 19:18.850
Leave the rest to us.
It's almost time.

19:19.180 --> 19:22.849
All assault teams in position,
begin advancing.

19:22.850 --> 19:26.139
Let me remind you that the top priority
is to rescue the hostage.

19:26.140 --> 19:27.849
Don't expect any backup.

19:27.850 --> 19:30.189
Whatever happens,
you're on your own.

19:30.190 --> 19:33.440
Excuse me!
Can someone give me a hand?

19:34.900 --> 19:37.910
Pig God is stuck!

19:38.530 --> 19:39.840
- Whoa.
- Whoa.

19:40.490 --> 19:41.950
RUMBLE

19:43.370 --> 19:44.410
I'm not stuck anymore.

19:44.800 --> 19:47.919
Master... Is this strategy wise?

19:47.920 --> 19:48.879
Huh?

19:48.880 --> 19:52.839
What? Any problem can be solved
with a slash of the blade.

19:52.840 --> 19:55.129
Okay, let's move on.

19:55.130 --> 19:56.800
Shall we go then?

19:57.300 --> 19:59.179
I-In any case...!

19:59.180 --> 20:01.340
I don't want any of you to die.

20:03.720 --> 20:08.690
You rushed out to gain victory.
Why have you returned?

20:09.000 --> 20:11.149
Did you kill any heroes?

20:11.150 --> 20:14.229
N-No... They were super strong and...

20:14.230 --> 20:16.899
Yeah, stronger than we expected.

20:16.900 --> 20:19.609
They're too much for us to handle.

20:19.610 --> 20:22.489
They've already killed
more than half of us.

20:22.490 --> 20:24.659
This is going in a bad direction.

20:24.660 --> 20:27.749
We thought numbers meant victory.
We were wrong.

20:27.750 --> 20:30.670
There's no way we're taking
such a dangerous risk.

20:31.010 --> 20:32.629
You don't want to die?

20:32.630 --> 20:34.919
Like hell I'd die so easily!

20:34.920 --> 20:37.879
We joined the
Monster Association to wreak havoc.

20:37.880 --> 20:42.309
I see. In that case,
you have no reason to exist.

20:42.310 --> 20:43.640
This is where you die.

20:46.600 --> 20:50.269
Huh? Wait! Gyoro-Gyoro!

20:50.270 --> 20:51.649
We can't stop it!

20:51.650 --> 20:53.399
Get away!

20:53.400 --> 20:54.860
SQUISH

20:55.610 --> 21:00.820
If you cannot even lose,
I will feed you to Lord Orochi.

21:03.330 --> 21:07.099
Must the leaders
and Demon-level monsters do everything?

21:07.100 --> 21:09.039
If you don't want to end up
as cubes of meat,

21:09.040 --> 21:12.790
then risk your lives
and get some intel on the enemy.

21:13.960 --> 21:18.010
What are you staring at?
Get going!

21:18.330 --> 21:22.009
I already instructed each of you
on which Class-S heroes to target.

21:22.010 --> 21:24.599
The fact remains,
the odds are still in our favor.

21:24.600 --> 21:26.949
Don't flinch at mere humans.

21:26.950 --> 21:27.720
Go!

23:16.500 --> 23:19.459
Looks like everyone made it in safely.

23:19.460 --> 23:22.299
The ending felt a bit too quick.

23:22.300 --> 23:25.339
That's because those guys
are Class-S heroes.

23:25.340 --> 23:28.299
Ordinary monsters don't stand
a chance against them.

23:28.300 --> 23:30.139
Yeah, I get that but...

23:30.140 --> 23:33.469
Hmm... He's got a point.

23:33.470 --> 23:35.979
Considering how elaborate
the trap was,

23:35.980 --> 23:39.059
they sure let us in pretty easily.

23:39.060 --> 23:41.819
I hope the senior heroes are okay.

23:41.820 --> 23:43.859
Whatever happens, happens.

23:43.860 --> 23:48.660
All the Class-S heroes have powers
that are beyond human comprehension.

23:52.120 --> 23:54.240
The real fight starts now.

23:55.910 --> 24:00.920
NINJA TALE
